keymasq (0.13.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add profile lifecycle macros that can run when a profile activates or
    deactivates.
  * Allow macro timelines to include compositor actions.
  * Warn before primary mouse button remaps instead of blocking them outright.
  * Improve key selector, input picker, device tab, macro dialog, and Super Key
    dialog layouts, including grave key support in keyboard layouts.

