keymasq (0.11.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add guided GNOME setup dialogs with DBus bridge detection and clearer
    recovery when GNOME integration needs setup, restart, or logout.
  * Add a Ctrl+Alt+Esc emergency combo: one tap cancels macro playback, and a
    double tap triggers an emergency reset.
  * Improve macro recording saves with pending-save protection and compressed
    macro storage.
  * Select newly created profiles immediately and apply them to the running
    session.
  * Allow zero-hold rapidfire timing and clamp timing fields to valid values.

